index 0000000..0f90fac
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-crud.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,97 @@
+Feature: Todo CRUD operations
+  As a user
+  I want to add, edit, and remove todos
+  So that I can manage my task list
+
+  Rule: Adding todos
+
+    Scenario: Pressing Enter adds a todo to the list
+      Given the app is open
+      When the user types "Buy milk" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+      Then the todo list contains 1 item
+      And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+      And the todo at position 1 is not completed
+      And the new todo input is empty
+
+    Scenario: Whitespace-only input is rejected
+      Given the app is open
+      When the user types "   " in the new todo input and presses Enter
+      Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+    Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating a todo
+      Given the app is open
+      When the user types "  Buy milk  " in the new todo input and presses Enter
+      Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+
+  Rule: Completing todos
+
+    Scenario: Clicking the checkbox marks a todo as completed
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user clicks the checkbox on todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+      And the todo list shows 0 items left
+
+    Scenario: Unchecking a completed todo makes it active
+      Given the app has a completed todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user clicks the checkbox on todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the todo "Buy milk" is not completed
+      And the todo list shows 1 item left
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+    Scenario: Double-clicking a todo label activates edit mode
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user double-clicks the label of todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+      And the edit input for todo "Buy milk" contains "Buy milk"
+      And the edit input for todo "Buy milk" is focused
+
+    Scenario: Pressing Enter while editing saves the new title
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+      When the user types "Buy eggs" in the edit input and presses Enter
+      Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy eggs"
+      And the todo "Buy eggs" is not in editing mode
+
+    Scenario: Blurring the edit input saves the new title
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+      When the user types "Buy eggs" in the edit input and blurs
+      Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy eggs"
+
+    Scenario: Editing to an empty string removes the todo
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+      When the user clears the edit input and presses Enter
+      Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+    Scenario: Pressing Escape discards edit changes
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+      When the user types "Buy eggs" in the edit input and presses Escape
+      Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+      And the todo "Buy milk" is not in editing mode
+
+  Rule: Removing todos
+
+    Scenario: Clicking destroy button removes a todo
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user clicks the destroy button on todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Rule: Clear completed button
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+      Given the app has a completed todo "Buy milk"
+      And the app has a todo "Buy eggs"
+      When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+      Then the todo list contains 1 item
+      And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy eggs"
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the Clear completed button is hidden
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when todos are completed
+      Given the app has a completed todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the Clear completed button is visible
